sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant NextApp as Next.js App
    participant NextAuth
    participant DB as MongoDB
    participant Email as Email Service

    User->>NextApp: Initiates email/password login
    NextApp->>NextAuth: Handles login attempt

    NextAuth-->>User: Prompts for email/password
    User->>NextAuth: Provides email/password

    NextAuth->>DB: Checks if user exists

    alt User doesn't exist (Sign Up)
        NextAuth->>DB: Creates new User
        NextAuth->>DB: Creates new Account (provider: credentials)
        NextAuth->>Email: Sends verification email (optional)
    else User exists (Sign In)
        DB-->>NextAuth: Returns user for password check
        NextAuth->>NextAuth: Verifies password
    end

    NextAuth->>NextAuth: Generates session
    NextAuth-->>NextApp: Returns session
